  "details": "I initially submitted a ticket to support about this but this also appears to be a website bug.\n\nIf a user in a group has a broken profile picture, moderators are unable to edit them in the group as their picture stays on the loading element. This causes issues in not being able to remove them if for example you were going to delete the group.\n\nUser I experienced this with.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/user/7tPs71oK3C",
